# Lights on the Lake at Currimundi

Christmas celebrations have begun! Last Sunday, Rhythm Culture provided a Christmas jam for 2014 and the crowd was jumping.  There were some gorgeous kids that danced for the entire hour in the circle, there were Christmas hats, drinks and lots of noise under the cool trees of Currimundi! Thanks for having us Catchment Care Group! - Sponsored by the Sunshine Coast Council. See more photos [here](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl "Currimundi Lights on the Lake")
